      <figure><button class="painting-open" data-painting="2602221saki.jpg" data-caption="个人纯手工绘画理解 · 02" aria-label="放大手绘作品二"><img src="/assets/hski-study/paintings/2602221saki.jpg" width="2835" height="3189" alt="个人纯手工绘画：粉色长发少女穿蓝白衣装，眨眼并托着玩偶，虹膜中有独立亮点"><span>查看原图 ↗</span></button><figcaption><span class="painting-number">02 / HAND PAINTED</span><h3>冷暖关系与局部亮点</h3><p>看蓝白衣装的明暗色块，以及眼睛里独立的小亮点。不同位置的亮，承担着不同的表达。</p><a href="#step=2" class="painting-jump" data-painting-step="2">对应阴影与肤色 →</a><a href="#step=6" class="painting-jump" data-painting-step="6">对应眼睛亮点 →</a></figcaption></figure>
